    <briefdescription>
<para>Composite instrument </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This instrument is an aggregate of other instruments. Its NPV is the sum of the NPVs of its components, each possibly multiplied by a given factor.</para><para><bold>Example: </bold> <ref refid="_replication_8cpp-example" kindref="compound">static replication of a down-and-out barrier option </ref></para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000052"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Methods that drive the calculation directly (such as <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_lazy_object_1a467a786be42a2165aa15a26709674547" kindref="member">recalculate()</ref>, <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_lazy_object_1abd8698b462ce90fe56b15ce7a0192d3e" kindref="member">freeze()</ref> and others) might not work correctly.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
